<title>USA: Caspian hires four analysts.</title>
<headline>Caspian hires four analysts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caspian Securities said Tuesday it had hired three Latin American stocks analysts and a global metals and mining analyst.</p>
<p>The firm said in a statement it had hired:</p>
<p>-- Esther Hiranobe as Brazil retail and home appliance analyst and Lilyanna Yang as Brazilian food and beverage analyst. Both had worked for Brazil's Geral do Comercio.</p>
<p>-- Maria Clara Cardoner as research analyst for Argentina. She most recently worked at Phoenix Duff &amp; Phelps Corp.</p>
<p>-- Lawrence Glaser as global metals and mining analyst. He worked previously as an exploration geologist.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
